{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/mixproto/mixcore/contracts/core-api/v0/command.schema.json",
  "title": "mixcore core API v0.3: Apply(commandJSON) and Gesture(commandJSON)",
  "description": "One user gesture. set writes a value; holdBegin/holdEnd mark a fader as held by a finger (no write). Only origin kinds gesture and macro are accepted; console and system are rejected with ERR_NOT_USER_ORIGIN. A set for a fader whose hold was ended by an external change or by losing the console is rejected with ERR_GESTURE_ENDED until the same client sends holdBegin or holdEnd for it. v0.1: toggle (field mute only, no value) reads the console's current value in the core and writes the inverse as an absolute value; it is the way to toggle a mute group or a DCA mute. muteGroups, dcas and effectiveMute cannot be written (ERR_UNSUPPORTED / ERR_INVALID_COMMAND). v0.3 (phone safety, docs/design/phone-safety.md): every set inside a hold is a gesture candidate the core clamps to the gesture window (slip guard, Gain caps, monitor ceiling, CR-22); openWall re-opens a slip-guard wall after the UI measured a rest; Gain writes are bounded to 6 dB from the console value (CR-23); typed raises over 6 dB need confirmed (CR-26); show mode locks raising Gain (CR-24). setSlipGuard and setShowMode change settings and never write.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "version",
    "type",
    "origin"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "version": {
      "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/version"
    },
    "type": {
      "enum": [
        "set",
        "holdBegin",
        "holdEnd",
        "toggle",
        "openWall",
        "unlock",
        "relock",
        "setSlipGuard",
        "setShowMode"
      ],
      "description": "v0.3 adds: openWall (param, after a 300 ms rest at a slip-guard wall: the next upward move continues from the wall, CR-22; the core checks the 300 ms itself and keeps the state atWall before that); unlock and relock (param {strip: headamp, field: gain}: the UI measured the 1 s 'Hold to adjust' in show mode / the sheet closed, CR-24); setSlipGuard (value boolean: 'Stop faders every 6 dB' for this origin's clientId, SR-26); setShowMode (value boolean: show mode for this engine, SR-27). None of them writes to the console."
    },
    "param": {
      "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/param"
    },
    "value": {
      "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/value"
    },
    "origin": {
      "$ref": "common.schema.json#/$defs/origin"
    },
    "typed": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "v0.3, set only: the value was typed on a keypad (or is an undo the user confirmed, SR-31). Typed entry is exempt from gesture windows and from the Gain 6 dB bound, but a raise of more than 6 dB needs confirmed (CR-26)."
    },
    "confirmed": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "v0.3, set only, with typed: the user confirmed the big raise ('Raise ... from -20.0 to -2.0 dB?'). Without it a typed raise of more than 6 dB returns ERR_NEEDS_CONFIRM."
    },
    "undo": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "description": "v0.3, set only: this write undoes an earlier entry. In show mode an undo that raises Gain is allowed for 10 s after the relock of the unlock it was made in (SR-27); it is still bounded to 6 dB unless typed and confirmed (SR-31)."
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "const": "set"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "value"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "holdBegin",
              "holdEnd"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "param": {
            "properties": {
              "field": {
                "const": "fader"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "value"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "const": "toggle"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "param": {
            "properties": {
              "field": {
                "const": "mute"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "value"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "set",
              "holdBegin",
              "holdEnd",
              "toggle",
              "openWall",
              "unlock",
              "relock"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "param"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "setSlipGuard",
              "setShowMode"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "value"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "value": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "param"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "unlock",
              "relock"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "param": {
            "properties": {
              "field": {
                "const": "gain"
              },
              "strip": {
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "const": "headamp"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "value"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "const": "openWall"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "value"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "not": {
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "const": "set"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "not": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "required": [
                "typed"
              ]
            },
            {
              "required": [
                "confirmed"
              ]
            },
            {
              "required": [
                "undo"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
